  "title": "Spinning assembly sheds a pod",
  "description": "RS-05b. A 4 kg hull with two 1 kg pods welded to its ends drifts and spins at 0.8 rad/s. At t = 2 s the right pod is detached: it leaves along the tangent with the velocity it had, and the remaining assembly's mass, centre of mass and inertia update.",
  "profile": "test",
  "seed": 1,
  "world": {
